    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7aa453355841fa4d849894b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "由于<color=#FF4400>【马场・距离的适应性均不佳】</color>\\n可能无法展现100%的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34f663526d05e7f1e69d7f89fbe0f3e3d9e609caa23d328ac1c1cf93756f1584",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a92d3c4ea66c09749afed48a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "气势正好，状态不错呢。\\n有望提名至<color=#FF6D26>【实力赛马娘中的1员】</color>呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0115f6e19b2613500b468a2821d4871e4fe4e3e087e575acdf109564a3f1e7d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34cf3c024228ffc29e401ab0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在的状态貌似可以放心参加比赛。\\n有望成为<color=#FF6D26>【实力赛马娘中的1员】</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44980ede28b3475b17b83cf2a4e8a74cf57f9af35e08696a1a57c1a0fc0e1cde",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdc51f8473681fcc2168c408",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有望提名至<color=#FF6D26>【实力赛马娘中的1员】</color>呢。\\n她能带来一场怎样的比赛，很令人期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0946eff9ecfb329d625d5726bb6aa9dfaef7d3776b1ea94d2054986285591f07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac7f1a53ef511fba4ee8cb4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "似乎能<color=#FF6D26>【跻身前列】</color>。\\n她能带来一场怎样的比赛，很令人期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade4399e74f9ee8c4e4d15b61d1560e6bb715c06d910fffd6f457d4af97cd552",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b27588d37b5bd606d3e5d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉好多了呢。\\n根据对手情况来看，算是<color=#FF6D26>【实力赛马娘中的1员】</color>呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a2162da10a2aba8a14b32bc26c1ceba6c300b32ec8f4820e39240f1b5376d53",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9f2c760f90fdc2dd1cbf562",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉好多了呢。\\n根据对手的表现，有望<color=#FF6D26>【跻身前列】</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c8416b07b2de4939b02fc2ff5a600c164a3a8a160243399958c0493bbcd6417",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c0fb1c91f0fe2a24e1ce2ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能顺利把控比赛的话，\\n<color=#FF6D26>【跻身前列】</color>的几率也很大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3f7aa58ea3cf1ecc489219e2f2b6d7da12e183648e5d62c3213a76ac8aa99c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0114be87947ec04f1bf23bff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能感觉出她有很高的资质。\\n拼尽全力的话，很有可能<color=#FF6D26>【跻身前列】</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f7f255117b3db18a5fec7a1165fd0ff60fcc59aa7a317934bd9b4f44ba18f0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "27",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aaf38f6bd3546d8531b4c66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能感觉出她有很高的资质。\\n拼尽全力的话，<color=#FF6D26>【进板的可能性】</color>也不低。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab5d4d84438fda119cd12369917f61971088829f786704d7198c23ea439c641f",
